      "content": "I'm really sorry you're going through this. It's natural to feel that way when things don't go as planned, but your worth isn't solely defined by that experience or by being \"perfect\" in someone's eyes. You didn't just let that \"perfect\" version perfect their definition of you, you let them see a whole person who is capable, talented, and resilient, even when faced with challenges. Remember, imperfection doesn't erase your history or the efforts you've invested. Focusing on rebuilding and growing from this experience can be incredibly powerful. We'd be here to support you on this journey.",
