      "content": "but that's the thing, they don't want to see the \"whole person.\" they wanted the high achiever. the one who makes them look good. i hate that i'm just gonna be the kid who lost it all, the one they have to constantly pity or worry about. the idea of them seeing me struggle like this, just... slowly falling apart... it's so much worse than if things just ended while they still remembered me as being successful. i feel like a ruined reputation is harder to live with than nothing at all. don't you think?",
